  "about": "Incorporated in 2016, Kalahridhaan Trendz Ltd is a textile dyeing & processing company[1]",
  "keyPoints": "Business Overview:[1]\nKTL is a textile dyeing and processing company. It provides design, construction, and management services for Textile Process. Company is mainly into manufacturing and trading of Fabric with embroidery works, Trading of grey cloths purchase of grey cloth, and printing and dyeing for preparing suiting shirting and dress materials. In case of Embroidery Segment, it undertakes embroidery work for its own business and for other clients. In addition to this, it gets embroidery work out sourced. \nThe Company also deals in purchase and sell of grey cloths as well as the suiting shirting and dress materials. It has taken over the textile Dying and printing business unit on rent basis where it is carrying out the dying and printing of suiting shirting and dress materials",
